{"completed": true, "response": "{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S08、S11、S12等短时段里，纵向交替的叙述和密集的到时感受不如X左右分栏容易一眼总览，快速扫读时可能顾此失彼。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮短语凸显每段心理支点，又让感受随音乐时点出现，尤其能抓住他既舍不得被当作自己人的亲近、又不愿重新忍受委屈这一核心矛盾。它从怀念、动摇、反复追问到最终带着想念继续生活，心理推进更连贯，音乐变化和身体感受也明显更细腻具体。X的优势是左右分区直观、快速总览更轻松，但整体表达的层次和音乐细节不如Y充分。\"\n}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4590c9ea-d77e-4d9b-8483-a24735778eaf", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T002257951399Z", "elapsed_seconds": 119.172, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:24:57.121045+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0da783e9c876410680481c028720a6aa73fd18aefbc34af971f11adcae86570f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2388500002